@page "/not-found"
@layout MainLayout

<PageTitle>Not found · osu!PersonalTracker</PageTitle>

<div class="mode-head">
    <h1 class="mode-title" tabindex="-1">Not found</h1>
    <span class="mode-sub">no screen here answers to that address</span>
</div>

<div class="panel">
    <div class="panel-title"><h2>Where to instead</h2><b>four screens, that is all there is</b></div>

    <p class="pace-none">
        If the address named a mode, the only ones this tracker counts are
        <b>osu!</b>, <b>taiko</b>, <b>catch</b> and <b>mania</b> — converts are excluded, so
        nothing else has a page.
    </p>

    <div class="filters" style="margin-top: 16px">
        <a class="f on" style="--mc: var(--osu)" href="">dashboard</a>
        <a class="f" href="modes/fruits">modes</a>
        <a class="f" href="browse">browse</a>
        <a class="f" href="badge">badge</a>
        <a class="f" href="sync">sync</a>
    </div>
</div>
